  "name": "Sweet and Sour Cabbage Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty cabbage soup with tender beef and a bright, balanced finish.",
  "description": "Beef shank makes a rich stock for Savoy cabbage, tomatoes, lemon, dill, and paprika in this generous soup.",
